[{"client_msg_id":"8ff3a9ba-fdb6-4c77-a5f2-9b18fb7ff397","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e\nバグっぽい挙動に出会ったのですが、issueたてたほうがいいでしょうか？\nsnippetをevaluateして展開する時、if文使えないみたいですね。↓がエラーになります。\n```  - name: nvim\n    keyword: vim\n\tsnippet: \"if command -v nvim \u0026gt; /dev/null; then echo nvim; else echo vim; fi\"\n    evaluate: true```\nどうも複数行に渡るsnippetがNGっぽいです。たとえば↓の場合、`x; echo y`と展開されてしまいます。\n```  - name: x\n    keyword: x\n    snippet: echo x; echo y \n    evaluate: true  ```\n`evaluate: false`な場合でも\n```snippet: |\n  echo x\n  echo y```\nみたいなことすると、一行目しか展開されないみたいです。","ts":"1634740180.392400","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1634740200.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"td7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3fa6e31-6ac4-4122-b3d9-fa52610ae506","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"こんなん","ts":"1634738513.386600","files":[{"id":"F02J85FS2NS","created":1634738512,"timestamp":1634738512,"name":"ssh-select.sh","title":"ssh-select.sh","mimetype":"text/plain","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"shell","pretty_type":"Shell","user":"UAZ33BKV2","mode":"snippet","editable":true,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":764,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02J85FS2NS/ssh-select.sh","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02J85FS2NS/download/ssh-select.sh","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/UAZ33BKV2/F02J85FS2NS/ssh-select.sh","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02J85FS2NS-cf3dea342a","edit_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/UAZ33BKV2/F02J85FS2NS/ssh-select.sh/edit","preview":"#!/bin/sh\nhost=\"\"\n# need backslash escape? ... currently not use backslash\nif which fzf \u003e/dev/null 2\u003e\u00261; then\n  host=$(grep -iEh \"^host[[:space:]]\" ~/.ssh/config ~/.ssh/conf.d/*.conf | sed -e 's/host[[:space:]]\\(.*\\)/\\1/i' | tr ' ' '\\n' |  grep -v -e '[*?]' -e '^[[:space:]]*$' | fzf  --prompt=\"Host\\\\\u003e \" --query=\"${*}\" --select-1 | xargs -n 1)","preview_highlight":"\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror cm-s-default CodeMirrorServer\" oncopy=\"if(event.clipboardData){event.clipboardData.setData('text/plain',window.getSelection().toString().replace(/\\u200b/g,''));event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();}\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror-code\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-meta\"\u003e#!/bin/sh\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-def\"\u003ehost\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-operator\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-comment\"\u003e# need backslash escape? ... currently not use backslash\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-keyword\"\u003eif\u003c/span\u003e which fzf \u0026gt;/dev/null \u003cspan class=\"cm-number\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u0026gt;\u0026amp;1; \u003cspan class=\"cm-keyword\"\u003ethen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"cm-def\"\u003ehost\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-operator\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e$(grep -iEh \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;^host[[:space:]]\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e ~/.ssh/config ~/.ssh/conf.d/*.conf | sed -e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e's/host[[:space:]]\\(.*\\)/\\1/i'\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e | tr \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e' '\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e'\\n'\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e |  grep -v -e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e'[*?]'\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e -e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e'^[[:space:]]*$'\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e | fzf  --prompt=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;Host\\\\\u0026gt; \u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e --query=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-def\"\u003e${*}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-quote\"\u003e --select-1 | xargs -n 1)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","lines":19,"lines_more":14,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"upload":true,"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bKmd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2af08c1-f33a-490f-be7a-1c7693bdcdca","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ちなみにsshコマンドにオプション足すと発火しないのでマッチパターンを少し考える必要がある（めんどくさくてやってない","ts":"1634738447.386200","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1634738460.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W7dM6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3902f57-7c94-446a-81f9-9dd902c82075","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そういえばこれはスニペットじゃなくてfzf補完か","ts":"1634738405.38